### Vehicles and Vehicle Logs API Contract
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/controle_ja_api/v1
@token = replace-with-access-token
@vehicleId = replace-with-vehicle-id
@start = 1717100000000
@end = 1748636000000

### Controller summary
### VehicleController gerencia cadastro, edição, exclusão e dashboard de veículos.
### VehicleLogController registra e consulta leituras do diário de bordo.

### Existing controller decisions
### - Toda rota exige Authorization Bearer token.
### - GET /vehicles/{id}, PUT, DELETE, dashboard e logs validam que o veículo pertence ao usuário.
### - currentOdometer inicial é obrigatório no cadastro do veículo.
### - Atualizar odômetro exige valor maior que o atual e passa por validação de salto plausível.
### - Diário de bordo exige odometerReading e também atualiza o odômetro atual do veículo.
### - dashboardKml do log é opcional; quando informado deve ser maior que zero.
### - Dashboard usa o Vehicle já autorizado pelo controller para evitar buscar o mesmo veículo duas vezes.
### - Dashboard calcula custo mensal, anual, custo por km, média de consumo e previsão quando houver dados confiáveis.

### Common error contract
### 400 Bad Request
### {
###   "code": 400,
###   "title": "Erro | Acesso negado | Erro de Validação",
###   "message": "Mensagem de regra ou validação"
### }
###
### 404 Not Found
### {
###   "code": "404",
###   "title": "Erro",
###   "message": "Veículo não encontrado ou já foi excluído."
### }

### Vehicle request contract
### {
###   "name": "string obrigatório",
###   "brand": "string obrigatório",
###   "model": "string obrigatório",
###   "year": "integer obrigatório, mínimo 1900",
###   "plate": "string opcional",
###   "currentOdometer": "decimal obrigatório; aceita até 1 casa decimal",
###   "tankCapacity": "decimal opcional, maior que zero quando informado"
### }

### Vehicle response contract
### {
###   "id": "uuid",
###   "name": "string",
###   "brand": "string",
###   "model": "string",
###   "currentOdometer": "decimal",
###   "avgGasoline": "decimal|null",
###   "avgEthanol": "decimal|null",
###   "year": "integer",
###   "plate": "string|null",
###   "tankCapacity": "decimal|null"
### }

### Vehicle log request contract
### {
###   "vehicleId": "uuid obrigatório",
###   "date": "epoch milliseconds obrigatório",
###   "odometerReading": "decimal obrigatório; aceita até 1 casa decimal",
###   "dashboardKml": "decimal opcional, maior que zero",
###   "drivingPredominance": "CITY | HIGHWAY | MIXED opcional"
### }

### Vehicle log response contract
### {
###   "id": "uuid",
###   "date": "epoch milliseconds",
###   "odometerReading": "decimal",
###   "dashboardKml": "decimal|null",
###   "drivingPredominance": "CITY | HIGHWAY | MIXED | null",
###   "vehicleName": "string"
### }

### Create vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Meu carro",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Corolla",
  "year": 2022,
  "plate": "ABC1D23",
  "currentOdometer": 50000.7,
  "tankCapacity": 50.0
}

### Expected 200 response
### Vehicle response contract.

### List my vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### [ Vehicle response contract ]

### Get my vehicle by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### Vehicle response contract.

### Update my vehicle
PUT {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Meu carro",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Corolla",
  "year": 2022,
  "plate": "ABC1D23",
  "currentOdometer": 51000.8,
  "tankCapacity": 50.0
}

### Expected 200 response
### Vehicle response contract.

### Delete my vehicle
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### {
###   "message": "Registro excluído com sucesso."
### }

### Get vehicle dashboard by period
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/dashboard?start={{start}}&end={{end}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### {
###   "monthlyCost": "decimal",
###   "yearlyCost": "decimal",
###   "costPerKm": "decimal",
###   "currentAvgKml": "decimal|null",
###   "remainingKms": "decimal|null",
###   "estimatedNextRefuelDate": "epoch milliseconds|null",
###   "estimatedNextRefuelCost": "decimal",
###   "estimatedNextCost": "decimal",
###   "lastRefuelAmount": "decimal|null",
###   "lastFuelPricePerLiter": "decimal|null",
###   "lastRefuelDistanceKm": "decimal|null",
###   "lastRefuelKml": "decimal|null",
###   "lastRefuelFuelType": "GASOLINA | ETANOL | null"
### }
### Notes:
### - monthlyCost/yearlyCost use vehicle direct expenses plus credit-card installments due in the period.
### - Credit-card purchases are not counted by their full original amount in the purchase month.

### Create vehicle log
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "date": 1717100000000,
  "odometerReading": 51250.4,
  "dashboardKml": 11.8,
  "drivingPredominance": "CITY"
}

### Expected 200 response
### Vehicle log response contract.

### List vehicle logs by period
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/logs/{{vehicleId}}?start={{start}}&end={{end}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### [ Vehicle log response contract ]

### Delete last vehicle log
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/logs/{{vehicleLogId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### {
###   "message": "Registro excluído com sucesso."
### }
### Notes:
### - Only the latest vehicle log for that vehicle can be deleted.
### - If the first log is also the latest/only log, it can be deleted.
### - Deleting a valid last log recalculates the vehicle currentOdometer from remaining logs, vehicle transactions and initial odometer.
### - Vehicle dashboard values are recalculated on the next dashboard request because logs affect KM driven, KM/L fallback and cost per KM.
